hwTWLXRwCV\" style=\"width: 437px; height: 395px;\" \/><\/div>\n\n<div><br \/>\n8.) The sequence below represents the <u>coding strand<\/u>, also called the non-template strand, of a gene from a rapidly mutating virus, starting with the sequence that encodes the translation initiation codon.<br \/>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br \/>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5&rsquo;&hellip;.ATGGCGACTATCGTTAAGTA&hellip;.3&rsquo;<br \/>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\nYou have isolated a mutant version of this gene that contains <u>three<\/u> base pair changes, underlined below.<br \/>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5&rsquo;&hellip;.ATGGC<u>C<\/u>ACTAT<u>A<\/u>GTT<u>T<\/u>AGTA &hellip;.3&rsquo;<br \/>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\nThis combination of mutations will result in:<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q8","QuestionType":"SBS","Selector":"SBSMatrix","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"SpecifyLabel","ChoiceColumnWidthPixels":670,"RepeatHeaders":"none","ColumnOrder":[1,0]},"QuestionDescription":"Q8","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"substitution of only one amino acid in the polypeptide product."},"2":{"Display":"substitution of multiple amino acids in the polypeptide product."},"3":{"Display":"a shorter mRNA transcript."},"4":{"Display":"a shorter polypeptide product."}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[{"ChoiceID":"4","AnswerID":"1","SeriesID":"1","Grades":{"SC1":"1"},"index":3},{"ChoiceID":"1","AnswerID":"1","SeriesID":"2","Grades":{"SC1":"1"},"index":4},{"ChoiceID":"2","AnswerID":"1","SeriesID":"2","Grades":{"SC1":"1"},"index":5},{"ChoiceID":"3","AnswerID":"1","SeriesID":"2","Grades":{"SC1":"1"},"index":6}],"Language":[],"NumberOfQuestions":1,"AdditionalQuestions":{"1":{"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"True"},"2":{"Display":"False"}},"Qu